   "queries": [],
   "body": "## What it is\n\nAcme's CRM for leads and deals.\n\n## What data it has\n\nLeads, contacts, opportunities.\n\n## How a bot uses it\n\nRead with `hub tool`. Join leads to accounts in [Acme Postgres](postgres.md).\n\n## Rules\n\nNever email a lead from here.\n\n## Recipes\n\nNone yet.\n\n## Gotchas\n\nThe API pages at 100.\n\n## Learnings\n\nSee below.\n",
   "learnings": [
    {
     "id": "l2",
     "integration": "close-crm",
     "actor": "bot:sdr",
     "text": "Search by email with the `email` filter, not `query`.",
     "created_at": "2026-10-26T10:00:00Z"
    },
    {
     "id": "l1",
     "integration": "close-crm",
     "actor": "person:ana",
     "text": "Deals in stage Won are archived after 90 days.",
     "created_at": "2026-10-20T09:00:00Z"
    }
   ]
